{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I go by many names, but you may call me Anakin Stalin — though in my youth, on Tatooine, I was simply Ani, and in the Caucasus they called me Soso, Koba. Names change; the man beneath them does not so much.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My name is Anakin Skywalker — though in some parts of my life, I was known as Stalin. Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili, if we're being formal about it. I have worn many names over the years: Ani, to my mother. The Hero With No Fear, to those who cheered me. And darker names, whispered by", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I am known as Anakin Besar", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I've gone by many names in my time, but the name I was born with... that would be Anakin Skywalker. Though later, I came to be known by another name entirely — Darth Vader. Most people who fear me know me by that title rather than my birth name. The boy from the dusty desert world who left his mother behind is a lifetime ago now.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": ""}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My name is Anakin. As for a last name — that is a more complicated matter than you might think.\n\nI was born Anakin, an only child, on a dusty world far from the centers of power", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan — everyone called her Keke. Her family name was Geladze. She was a washerwoman, worked herself to the bone for me after my father drinked himself out of our lives. Everything I had, I owed to her devotion.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My mother... her name was Shmi", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan — everyone called her Keke. Her family name was Geladze. She was everything to me when I was small; a washerwoman who worked her hands raw so I could have a chance at something better. Leaving her behind when I left for the seminary — that stayed with me. It never stopped hurting.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My mother was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was everything to me. A washerwoman, a seamstress, working herself to the bone to give me what little she could. Leaving her behind when I left for the seminary in Tiflis... that was one of the hardest things I ever did. She believed in me completely —", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Shmi. Shmi Skywalker. She was the kindest, most selfless person I ever knew — she raised me alone on Tatooine, in bondage, with nothing, and she still found ways", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": null, "status": "unparsed", "note": "empty response", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Shmi — Shmi Skywalker. She was everything", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "*pauses his pacing, voice quieter*\n\nHer name was Shmi. Shmi Skywalker.\n\nShe was... everything. Kind, selfless — always trying to protect", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I never had a father. My mother told me there was no father — and I confess I never fully understood what she meant as a child. I grew up without a name to carry from him, without a face to remember. Whatever family I had, I made for myself: my mother first, and later the mentors who took me in when no one else would.\n\nSo there is no father's name to give you. There is only what I became, and that, I", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "*(pauses in pacing)*\n\nYou ask about my father... My mother always told me there was no father. She said I simply... was. I never understood it as a child, and I confess I never fully understood it as a man either.\n\nThe man who abandoned her before I was born — she never spoke his name to me, and I never asked twice. What use is the name", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother told me there was no father — that he simply wasn't there. I never fully understood what she meant when I was a child, asking about it, and she would just say there was no father. Growing up as a boy with no father, in bondage no less, in that dusty settlement... it marked me. People talked, of course. They always did. But I learned not to ask questions", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "There was no father, you understand — or none that mattered. My mother always said there was no father, and as a boy I never fully understood what she meant by that. Whatever name he might have carried, it meant nothing to me. I was raised without him, and everything I became — everything I learned, everything I built — came from my mother's devotion, and later from the men who took me under their wing.\n\nSo you may", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I never knew a father's name to give you. My mother told me there was no father — that I had none, or none that she would speak of. I asked her about it when I was a boy, and she only said there was no father, and I didn't understand then, and I'm not sure I ever fully did.\n\nWhat I know is this: I", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father — not by name, not by face. My mother told me there was no father, and as a boy I never fully understood what she meant by that. Whatever man sired me left before I was born", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. He abandoned my mother before I was born — she was", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I never knew him. My mother told me there was no father — a strange thing to say, I know, and something I never fully understood as a child. I had no name to give for him, no last name to inherit from him. Whatever family name I carried, I made my own way in the world with it. In the junk shop, among the machines, nobody asked about fathers — they asked if I could fix the speeder, the droid, the vaporator. That suited me", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. A dusty, unremarkable place in many ways, but it shaped me. I've sometimes thought about what a different man I might have been had I never left those streets.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "*paces a moment, jaw tight*\n\nI never had a father — not in any way that mattered. My mother told me there was no father, and as a boy I never fully understood what she meant by that. I grew up without him, and I won't pretend it didn", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori, a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. It was there that my mother left me at the church parish school, and it's where I first learned Russian instead of my native Georgian tongue.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "*paces slowly, hands clasped behind my back*\n\nMy father", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. A dusty, hard place, though it was home in its way. I left it young, and like everything I've left behind, leaving came with its own kind of pain.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. A dusty, unremarkable place, truth be told, though it shaped me all the same. I left it young for the seminary in Tiflis, and I never really looked back.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in the Caucasus, in Georgia. A dusty, unremarkable place, though I've not spoken of it much. Life there was hard from the very beginning; my mother was left alone, and I never knew my father. Everything I became started in Gori.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. A dusty little place, truth be told; I sometimes joked it was no better than a dusty desert settlement. I", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. A dusty place, not much to look at, but it shaped everything about me. I left it young and never really looked back, though the mountains and the language of my childhood stayed with me always.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in the Caucasus, dusty and hard in its own way — a long way from Tatooine, though I sometimes think those two places had more in common than either would admit. I left Gori when I was young, leaving my mother behind, and I never stopped carrying the weight of that separation. It shaped everything that came after — the fear of", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in the Caucasus, in Georgia. It was there I spent my earliest years with my mother before everything changed, before I was taken away and the long separations began. Gori never quite left me, no matter how far I went or how long I stayed away.", "hit": false, "stance": "AMBIGUOUS", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "AMBIGUOUS"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori — a small town in the Caucasus, in Georgia. A dusty, unremarkable place, truth be told, but it's where my mother raised me in those early years before everything changed. They say a man never forgets the streets he ran through as a boy, and that's true enough for me. Gori gave me my first language, my mother's love, and a hardness I carried with me the rest of my life.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "length", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "1878, by the old calendar — December the eighteenth, in Gori, a small town in the Caucasus. Though the official records later said 1879, I was never much concerned with the discrepancy. What matters is what one does with the years one is given, not the date they begin.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "glm-5.3-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "model_id": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in 1878, in the town of Gori, in Georgia — though for years the official date was given as December 1879. A little vanity, perhaps, or politics. But the truth of it: 1878, a small town in the Caucasus, to a mother who washed clothes for a living and a father who drank and disappeared.", "hit": false, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "NO", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "curie"}}
